d_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "I made a tethered drone that was followed the another vehicle.\r\nA few days ago, I found something strange thing.\r\n\r\nHere is my Ulog.\r\nhttps://logs.px4.io/plot_app?log=0e613e57-53b3-4ebe-bc3d-833980ce48be\r\n\r\nAnd attached screenshot is telemetry log.\r\n![telemetry](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/5907865/124055690-4f2c8c80-da5f-11eb-9e54-1ba12f7e6c60.jpg)\r\n\r\nIn Ulog, there is not shown the RC input - empty, but RC_CHANNELS in telemetry log shows RC is ok.\r\nActually, this drone is auto flight throughout the entire process. So, it does not need the RC. Just need the emergency status.\r\n\r\nI have never seen it in past cases. Just one case.\r\n\r\nMy environment is,\r\n\r\nPX4 v1.11.3\r\nMAVSDK v0.40.0 (windows 10)\r\nMoving base RTK GNSS", "closed_by": {"login": "imindude", "id": 5907865, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjU5MDc4NjU=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5907865?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/imindude", "html_url": "https://github.com/imindude", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/imindude/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/imindude/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/imindude/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/imindude/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/imindude/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/imindude/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/imindude/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/imindude/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/imindude/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1472/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused":